WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:04.620
We generally host live shows, of course we are happy to see the excitement

2
00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:10.140
of the audience. But today I felt so good to see them along with their

3
00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.600
