4
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:16.380
Becoming an icon is definitely not an easy job.

5
00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:22.380
It takes a lot of effort, it takes a lot of perseverance and I am so overwhelmed

6
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:27.540
